    "body": "One problem I can see with yet another callback in the event-loop, it that the changes made in that callback would get missed by all these observers. Then we'll want a `FinalObserver` of some sort to tackle these, etc.\r\n\r\nI feel the best would be to have a way to limit the possible actions in this hook to compositing related actions only, so maybe a `Worklet` like [`PaintWorklet`](https://drafts.css-houdini.org/css-paint-api/#paint-worklet) would actually be the best place for such updates, though the limited API of this latter is certainly an issue.",
